      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I keep my mic muted most of the time and only unmute for a short while when I have something to say. I really only care to know when my mic is unmuted so I don't make stupid sounds. And I don't want to look at a muted mic icon all the time. For me the current change is the worst so far. I'm heavily considering making an avatar based mic indicator for myself",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
