      "mergeID": "654ef3f5914ae059afca16ee",
      "mergedPostDetails": "in 2023.4.1p2 mic fade in was removed and only exists when mic is muted. This was done to prevent burn in on OLED displays. But I personally depended on the fade in to quickly determine if my mic was working without opening my quick menu. For the majority of users without OLED displays, give more granular options for users for when the mic icon should fade in or out.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Allow mic icon fade in while talking",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "654d82a0912d29b995ec596d",
