      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As someone with a Bigscreen Beyond I really dislike the mic icon fade behavior change. It doesn't really make any sense to me to only have the mic icon show up when you're talking while muted. That... doesn't really help me at all. I want to know when my mic is being picked up while unmuted. Would love for a new option to bring the pre-1375 mic icon behavior back or just a straight up revert.",
