      "statusChangeID": "655e290f168b5845581e9a07",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "Thank you all for your feedback!\n\nThe new fading behaviour is now an option, and the default has been returned to what it was. We still recommend switching to it if you are using an OLED headset and are concerned about burn-in.\n\nWe are also working on further mitigation strategies for burn-in.",
